[I] X Trap Library

[T] This package contains the sample clients provided with the XTrap X
[T] server extension version 3.3, which facilitates capturing server
[T] protocol and synthesizing core input events. XTrap is deprecated in
[T] favor of XTEST and RECORD.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/app/xtrap

